comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-12T14:14:53.413Z",codex-sol,"Engine certifies listAllComplete before filtering and retains the whole corpus for hierarchy and duplicate context. PML010 delegates scoring to SDK duplicates with an explicit complete cluster limit. Findings contain static hints and ids, never item text."
  "2026-10-12T14:19:38.868Z",codex-sol,"SDK gap: duplicate analysis limits output to 1000 clusters. PML010 uses public sdk/query analyzeDuplicateItems on certified immutable rows, preserving SDK scoring and pair safety limits. Reaching the cluster cap fails closed rather than omitting findings. This also removes a second tracker scan and its race."
  "2026-10-12T14:33:13.203Z",codex-sol,"Behavioral revert proof: node --test test/engine.test.ts passes 6/6. Reverting only lintItems to the pre-feature empty-finding behavior produces 4 assertion failures; restoring the original function passes 6/6. Tests import source, so no dist rebuild was needed."
